{"first_seen_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","query":"__detail_manifest__","raw":{"text":"[]"},"provenance":{"provider":"Longbridge","search_tools":["news_search","news_detail"],"branch":"research/event-regime-v1-20260920","dedupe_result_unique_articles":18,"detail_fields_preserved":["id","title","description","url","author.member_id","author.name","published_at"],"note":"Search-list 1970 timestamps were treated as invalid. published_at/source come from Longbridge news_detail. first_seen_at_hkt is conservatively rounded forward to 23:00 HKT and is never backdated.","detail_manifest_part":"1/2"},"new_articles":[{"id":"299559984","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299559984","content_identity_sha256":"99199f5d5a7b3f1f95b57419da6197e3c69c5a6c9ff4da0c18d2189e95f4ee30","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T14:02:23Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"Unusual Whales","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299559984","title":"根据 Glassnode 和 Bybit 的数据，在过去两年中，持有比特币以外的任何资产都是无利可图的。在比特币占据主导地位的同时，风险市场中泡沫正在积聚","description":"根据 Glassnode 和 Bybit 最近的报告，目前的周期呈现出市场的显著分歧。尽管比特币在市场中占据主导地位，但在风险最高的领域中却出现了投机活动的积累。这种分歧突显了市场内部的对比趋势，风险资产在比特币稳定表现的同时，正获得显著的关注和投资","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299559984","author":{"member_id":"5899","name":"Unusual Whales"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T14:02:23Z"}},{"id":"299558794","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299558794","content_identity_sha256":"c58aca05662836b0c05613c92e6656fde3740dee0fc84675ed5f0310f547190f","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T13:34:11Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299558794","title":"比特币突破 50 周移动平均线，Doctor Profit 称","description":"分析师 Doctor Profit 表示，比特币突破了接近 78,700 美元的 50 周移动平均线，预示着潜在的新牛市。历史数据显示，七次此类突破中有五次导致了牛市。若周线收盘高于该水平，将确认这一趋势，预计在 82,500-83,000 美元以上会有更强的确认。该分析师维持现货头寸，目标为 88,000 美元","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299558794","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:34:11Z"}},{"id":"299558396","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299558396","content_identity_sha256":"1dd477527d38b4939f732176393a1ff8e5f8802ac4e83130be69a86bcb56d628","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T13:25:16Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299558396","title":"Strategy 的首席执行官称，公司旨在成为比特币领域的摩根大通","description":"Strategy 的首席执行官 Phong Le 旨在将公司转型为 “比特币的摩根大通”，通过创建产品、建立市场和为数字资产经济提供流动性。Le 针对全球用户群体，强调了 150 亿美元的数字信贷生态系统，并指出 DeFi 收益产品在 STRC 上的重要性。该公司采用长期积累与灵活性的双重比特币策略，最近选择了股票回购而非提高股息，反对 MSCI 排除，并在其运营中整合了人工智能工具","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299558396","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:25:16Z"}},{"id":"299558057","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299558057","content_identity_sha256":"2341223e6ca51a11f9fcac5c92801efa3a0f0e8123cf49e95ca315c3abcf28fc","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T13:04:39Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299558057","title":"Michael Saylor 发布了新的比特币追踪器预告","description":"迈克尔·塞勒（Michael Saylor），Strategy 的创始人兼执行主席，发布了另一条比特币追踪更新，并配文：“再多一点橙色。” 根据 ChainCatcher 的消息，Strategy 通常会在此类帖子发布后的第二天披露其比特币持有量的变动","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299558057","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:04:39Z"}},{"id":"299557471","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299557471","content_identity_sha256":"cc3e454602057a85a44d1ddf09a4d2da230bbb7a2630a5056f77a9bd2b7449ae","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T12:54:27Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299557471","title":"Strive 首席执行官暗示在持有量超过 25,000 BTC 后可能再次进行大规模比特币购买","description":"Strive 首席执行官 Matt Cole 在周日发布了一张橙色圆点的图片，并配文 “加速”，这是因为该公司上周的比特币持有量超过了 25,000 BTC。根据 ChainCatcher 的消息，这条帖子暗示 Strive 可能会在明天宣布另一笔大额比特币购买","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299557471","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T12:54:27Z"}},{"id":"299556911","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299556911","content_identity_sha256":"b6521e12a25aeee59fecf37a40d41af1bc4f877d6bc93bdb1fdc844781e371ea","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T11:31:39Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"Beincrypto","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299556911","title":"币安 70% 的山寨币已经恢复，但山寨币季节指数却显示出不同的情况","description":"虽然 70% 的币安山寨币已经恢复到其 200 日均线之上，总山寨币市值重新回到 8000 亿美元，但山寨币季节指数却降至 41。这表明，在过去 90 天中，前 50 名山寨币中有不到一半的表现优于比特币。因此，尽管相对于美元的价格有所恢复，但相对于比特币的广泛强势尚未显现，比特币的市场主导地位上升至 59.34%。分析师警告称，这一积极结构可能会迅速逆转","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299556911","author":{"member_id":"5992","name":"Beincrypto"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T11:31:39Z"}},{"id":"299555019","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299555019","content_identity_sha256":"de41810828c180456fcbf9c76e831e4c9374e5639f55e6f3e700ec331ec9a3d5","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T11:23:56Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299555019","title":"Darkfost 表示场外交易的比特币储备降至历史新低","description":"加密分析师 Darkfost 报告称，场外交易（OTC）比特币储备已降至约 123,000 BTC，创下历史新低，而在 2021 年 9 月时接近 500,000 BTC。这一下降表明长期持有需求更强，持有者的所有权更加分散，并且持有者更倾向于通过公开市场销售而非场外渠道。因此，如果现货市场购买增加，交易所外的可用性减少可能会支持比特币价格","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299555019","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T11:23:56Z"}},{"id":"299553790","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299553790","content_identity_sha256":"460eb3cc314e9f459d3f2e72a1077bc0960fbf278c80b668c01733bd6ba5febc","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T10:45:14Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299553790","title":"比特币在价格超过 84,356 美元时面临 12.9 亿美元的空头平仓风险","description":"如果比特币突破 $84,356，可能会在主要中心化交易所触发 $12.9 亿的累计空头平仓。根据 ChainCatcher 的数据，Coinglass 的数据显示，如果 BTC 跌破 $76,969，主要中心化交易所的累计多头平仓将达到 $8.52 亿","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299553790","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T10:45:14Z"}},{"id":"299545727","dedupe_key":"longbridge-news-id:299545727","content_identity_sha256":"af08a508442cb0d8b3a4817647854740b03c6b4d564873a5de2ea297669f1417","matched_queries":["Bitcoin"],"first_seen_at_hkt":"2026-09-20T23:00:00+08:00","search_timestamp_raw":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","search_timestamp_usable":false,"published_at_utc":"2026-09-20T06:44:01Z","timestamp_quality":"verified_detail","source":"CoinLive","detail_evidence":{"provider":"Longbridge","tool":"news_detail","id":"299545727","title":"持有时间至少为一年的比特币供应量上升至 63.3%","description":"根据 Maketo 的 HODL 波数据，截止到 9 月 18 日，比特币的供应份额在至少一年之前最后一次移动的比例上升至 63.3%，而在 8 月 18 日时为 62.32%。根据 NS3.AI 的分析，这一增长表明更多的供应处于较老的年龄段，但并不能证明当前的购买或故意从市场撤回。报告指出，需要实体调整后的余额、交易所流动和支出行为来验证新的积累理论","url":"https://longbridge.com/news/299545727","author":{"member_id":"5999","name":"CoinLive"},"published_at":"2026-09-20T06:44:01Z"}}]}